ull}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-03-06T13:30:04Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T22:42:19Z","closed_at":"2025-03-06T22:42:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you load a Resource in editor with CACHE_MODE_IGNORE, it will cause Resource folding to get loaded via loaded callback:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/134da374975114ef8e05cf81d1d30eff645e310e/editor/editor_node.cpp#L6706-L6708\nWhich marks the Resource as edited (the original one, not the one you just loaded):\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/134da374975114ef8e05cf81d1d30eff645e310e/core/object/object.cpp#L1657-L1658\nWhich makes it subject to external save:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/134da374975114ef8e05cf81d1d30eff645e310e/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1851-L1854\n\nWhile it's obvious that it can cause excessive saving, there is a particularly fun case where if you unfold a section, it will cause perpetual saving of that Resource. It happens with scripts:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/134da374975114ef8e05cf81d1d30eff645e310e/editor/plugins/script_editor_plugin.cpp#L2862-L2866\nIf Script resource has any section unfolded, it will be marked as edited when folding is loaded, which causes reload dialog to popup (bug) and when you chose to reload the script, the folding gets loaded again, marking the Script as edited and triggering another save etc.\n\nThis is the basic principle behind #103236\n\nIdeally folding should not be handled by Object, because it leads to obscure behavior like described above.\nOr at least loading folding should not mark the Resource as modified, because it makes no sense.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee description.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103694/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103694/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}